{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f4c8941c9034ccea4c9d875fd727780cf88391e74026e03553e881abc971c718", "ja": "（エナジードリンクのCMに紗代子が抜擢された。\n今日は、新商品のCM撮影があるのだが……）", "zh": "（紗代子被选中出演能量饮料的广告。\n今天要拍摄新产品的广告，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "fae4604584f6c9791aaf9c4a1a04e7dcf939c0ed773afa049ed9857118194dca", "ja": "うーん。もっと元気な方がいいのかな～？　でも、\n絵コンテのイメージに合わせないといけないし……。", "zh": "嗯——是不是应该再精神一点呢～？不过，也得配合分镜的感觉才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b2e2f7905dc4db01c268ce2e7a4fb8fcf6589b5435d262a98c07ea4f17d710e", "ja": "大丈夫か、紗代子？\n急に撮影が中断して、ビックリしたよ。", "zh": "没事吧，纱代子？\n拍摄突然中断，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "2b851b85604567caf01160deb8c9f3cd199484ea8871f1117609df881feb0272", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nご迷惑をおかけして、すみません。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n给您添麻烦了，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f4fb54e2becffae4d58e90276a0e0811710c63fb3def3843598406cc7151d0ec", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。最後のセリフで\n止まったみたいだけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "没事，没关系的。看你好像卡在\n最后一句台词那里了，是遇到什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "6a2bebfd75a18e5cc238dfd91e42c5a2f68e01d6aea4f1a46d171117f105eea5", "ja": "はい。今日の撮影のために、自分でも\nいくつか演技プランを考えてきたんです。", "zh": "好的。为了今天的拍摄，我自己也想了几个表演方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "b964d741fdb071eea42657786215ef98f3c9558cfbf0b11a40104f0c2a108565", "ja": "商品を印象づける大事な部分ですから！\n元気さや、熱さを出す感じにしようかなって。", "zh": "毕竟是给商品留下深刻印象的关键部分！\n我就想表现出活力与热情的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "262d8e351bbaf8ac1c9afe8cecf107f3791d5f69e2b366e024cbcad3cfa92497", "ja": "私がこのCMに選ばれたのって、そういう、\n熱いところが理由かと思ったんですけど……うう。", "zh": "我以为自己被选中拍这个广告，\n是因为那种热情劲儿……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "95836d633cec04aa7928470ce96bf5702040182c833bd9075d913230353cdb7b", "ja": "なるほど。それで監督さんに見てもらったら、\nちょっと違ったってことか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以让导演看过之后，发现其实有点不一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "928aa62906fe261afea7fbd385d99784386f4965a7013d38cec7ef8f177e303e", "ja": "はい……。さっき、合成するCGの映像を見せて\nもらったんです。とってもクールでカッコよくて……。", "zh": "是的……刚才，导演给我看了要合成的CG画面。特别酷，特别帅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "032767bf9358986d3d5a4a12651123b4499cd6cde6e7dd3383d3c9e571803977", "ja": "考えた演技だと合わないって、すぐわかりました。\nだからお願いして、考える時間をもらったんです。", "zh": "我马上就明白了，照自己想的那样去演是不合适的。所以我拜托他们，让我有时间好好想一想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d1085ddd5b73c8bcbc166292811b3599709262c0bee0e83b33f397c1962c0ddf", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nその様子だと、解決策はみつかってなさそうだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n看你的样子，似乎还没找到解决办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "c03b4eac984cfc142d90e33be26a0b97d5175ed5c32ab9e4ee75610e8023779b", "ja": "そうなんです。時間をもらった以上は、\nちゃんと答えを見つけなきゃいけないのに……。", "zh": "是这样的。既然已经争取到了时间，就必须好好找到答案才行，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "c3fef7399a65823aff93514da1d8e5ba13bbcc9ed385c6bad0839e8b37ac5834", "ja": "{$P$}……\n元気や熱いだけじゃ、ダメなんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n光有活力、够热情，还是不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_1014", "source_sha256": "851e6fd55ec2374b4955613db952e8c7ee7991525482c3290537b13f8dca191f", "ja": "そのままでいい", "zh": "保持这样就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2000_p", "source_sha256": "119357c15a60787e98cec4cd692ae0ee5d0c49ba1e7b48669d495fbd982cf2bb", "ja": "いや、いつもの紗代子のままでいいと思う。\nただ、その熱さを渡す相手のことを考えてみよう。", "zh": "不，我觉得保持平时的纱代子那样就好。\n只是，试着考虑一下把这份热情传递给的对象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2001_p", "source_sha256": "6265535effa8263e6d0ca639fa680800b66d4e0736c088bee278f9f448278e0e", "ja": "紗代子が元気になってほしい人、応援したいと思う人に\nどうやって、熱さを渡す？", "zh": "要怎么把这份热情传递给希望纱代子打起精神、想要支持的人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2002_027say", "source_sha256": "ba5e7ed20bf47540ddc3be76ba9c10cc73423508df8ef237b748aa757c4c648b", "ja": "どうやってって……。あっ、そっか。\n私、言葉のイメージに引っ張られてたのかも……。", "zh": "怎么说……啊，原来如此。\n我可能被这个词给带偏了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "4d510dccd0ff297dfbb72935e8681c1e1f001d25f203092cd07736c5a35b5193", "ja": "熱さはそのまま。でもクールに堂々と……うんっ！\nこの演技プランなら、いけるかもしれないです！", "zh": "热情保持不变，但要冷静而堂堂正正地……嗯！\n按照这个演技方案，说不定能行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2004_p", "source_sha256": "98409db44604b6b6e75f4f9bb6752956966fc82bc555af29e736c7d2f1d79cfe", "ja": "そうか！\nそれじゃ、監督さんのところに行ってみよう。", "zh": "这样啊！\n那我们去导演那边看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2005_027say", "source_sha256": "566cc0bb45ea46b1d94dc6b67ef3a4d594a6dd80e6322948e9d1f12cdfc0fd7c", "ja": "はいっ！　撮影を止めてしまった分の遅れは、\n本番で挽回してみせます！　ふふ♪", "zh": "好的！耽误拍摄的进度，我会在正式拍摄时追回来给你看！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0294_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8937d527f82e3c4dc4060f2c9b644ade7b7b52965e6db40e42867bb577f5475d", "ja": "（その後、紗代子のプランは無事採用された。\n熱さのあるクールでカッコいいCMに仕上がった！）", "zh": "（之后，纱代子的方案顺利被采纳了。最终做成了一支热血又冷酷帅气的广告！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
